            <p>The San Diego-to-Los Angeles train route runs along the Southern California coast, traveling north parallel to the Pacific Ocean through one of the most scenic rail corridors in the United States. Passengers get spectacular views of the Pacific Ocean, coastal bluffs, sandy beaches, and charming beach towns, making the journey more than just transit - it's a relaxed and picturesque experience. </p>

