                <li><b>Recommended Arrival:</b>20-30 minutes before departure.</li>
                <li> <b> Facilities:</b> Ticket counters, waiting areas, restrooms, small cafés, baggage services, and paid parking.</li>
                <li> <b> Architecture: </b> The station features beautiful Spanish Colonial Revival architecture - worth arriving early to appreciate.</li>
                <li> <b>Signage:</b> Platforms and departure boards are clearly marked for easy navigation.</li>
                <li> <b>Transit Access:</b> Easily reachable via San Diego Trolley (Blue, Green, Orange Lines), MTS buses, Coaster commuter rail, and rideshare services.</li>
                <li> <b> Other Departure Points: </b> Some trains also stop at Old Town San Diego Transit Center and Sorrento Valley, offering additional boarding options.</li>
            </ul>
