                <li> <b> Environment: </b> Quiet, especially in Business Class; designated quiet cars on some services.</li>
                <li> <b>Scenery:</b> Enjoy breathtaking views of the Pacific Ocean, coastal bluffs, sandy beaches, San Clemente pier, Dana Point harbor, and the Orange County coastline.</li>
